      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T07:31:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if we add config for multiple devices into single `Exposes` object? This would make config smaller and easier to read for vr-nvl board since all gpus and cx can be grouped together. However we can have separate configs for HPM SMAs and property `Devices` would be array of size of 1.\n\n\n```\n{\n  \"Name\": \"CX8\",\n  \"Type\": \"NvidiaMctpVdmCx\",\n  \"Devices\": [\n    {\n      \"PlatformConfigName\": \"CX8_1\",\n      \"DeviceName\": \"ConnectX_\",\n      \"AppendInstanceIdToDeviceName\": True\n    },\n    {\n      \"PlatformConfigName\": \"CX8_2\",\n      \"DeviceName\": \"ConnectX_\",\n      \"AppendInstanceIdToDeviceName\": True\n    }\n  ],\n  \"PortCount\": 2\n}\n```",
      "revId": "946cd1f026b25fbd837c838cfc8eda3dae6d9866",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
